    "regime_notes": "Positive and above admission gates in 2020-22 (IC 0.04427, ICIR 0.09211) and 2023-25 (0.04633, 0.10419); weakened but remained positive in 2026-30 (0.02713, 0.06742), indicating current-regime stability risk. Small 15-asset cross-section implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_2_20300822_residual_reversal_signal.csv"
